    "custom_liquid_gikzEq": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"brand-story\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;\">\n  <h2>Why Fashion Lovers Choose Milvertons</h2>\n  \n  <h3>✨ Italian Design, African Soul</h3>\n  <p>\n    At Milvertons, we believe luxury fashion should honor both heritage and innovation. Our <strong>Italian shoe and bag sets</strong> are inspired by Milanese craftsmanship—sleek silhouettes, precision embellishment, and timeless elegance—while celebrating the vibrant spirit of African celebrations. From Lagos to London, Atlanta to Accra, our designs are made for women who refuse to compromise on style or cultural pride.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>💎 Crafted for Special Occasions</h3>\n  <p>\n    Every Milvertons <strong>shoe and bag set</strong> in our collections is curated for the grandeur of <strong>African weddings</strong>, the tradition of <strong>Aso Ebi</strong>, and the most prestigious <strong>Owambe celebrations and galas</strong>. We understand the importance of coordinated looks: our matching shoe and bag sets eliminate the stress of styling, so you can focus on celebrating. Whether you need <strong>bridal heels with a clutch</strong> or statement rhinestone sets for a guest look, we've curated collections that photograph beautifully and feel luxurious all night long.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>🌱 Sustainable Luxury, Exclusively Curated</h3>\n  <p>\n    We partner with ethical manufacturers who prioritize quality over quantity. Our limited-edition collections ensure you won't see your look at every event—because your style should be as unique as your story. Plus, our commitment to sustainable materials means you can shine with confidence.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>🚚 US-Based, Diaspora-Focused</h3>\n  <p>\n    Unlike UK-based competitors, Milvertons ships orders from the USA with <strong>free domestic shipping</strong> and no customs surprises. We understand the African diaspora experience—fast delivery, easy returns, and customer service that gets your cultural context. Based in California, serving the world.\n  </p>\n  <p>\n  🛍️ Shop elegant Italian shoe and bag sets designed for weddings, parties, and special occasions. Our matching heels and bags are crafted for women who want a polished, coordinated look without the stress of styling separate accessories.\n  </p>\n</section>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 16
      }
    },
