    "custom_liquid_3wwRM4": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"homepage-story-expanded\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;\">\n  <h2>From Milan to Lagos: The Milvertons Curation Journey</h2>\n  \n  <h3>Our Mission: Curating Luxury for the African Diaspora</h3>\n  <p>\n    Milvertons was born from a simple observation: African women attending weddings, galas, and Aso Ebi celebrations deserved access to luxury shoe and bag sets that honored both their cultural heritage and their modern aspirations—but finding them required endless scrolling through overseas sites, uncertain sizing, and risky shipping. We set out to solve this by becoming your trusted curators.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    We don't manufacture—we <strong>curate</strong>. Our team scours global markets, fashion weeks, and artisan networks to source the finest <strong>Italian-inspired shoe and bag sets</strong> that meet our strict standards for style, quality, and cultural relevance. Then, we bring them to you with US-based service, clear sizing, and reliable shipping. Think of us as your personal luxury fashion buyer, specializing in African celebrations.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>Our Curation Philosophy: Quality Without Compromise</h3>\n  <p>\n    Every Milvertons set undergoes rigorous vetting before it reaches our collection. We evaluate:\n  </p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Design Authenticity:</strong> Does it capture Italian elegance—sleek silhouettes, precision embellishment, timeless proportions?</li>\n    <li><strong>Cultural Relevance:</strong> Will it complement Ankara prints, lace fabrics, and the bold palettes of African fashion?</li>\n    <li><strong>Quality Standards:</strong> Premium PU leather, secure rhinestone setting, durable hardware, comfortable construction</li>\n    <li><strong>Value Proposition:</strong> Luxury aesthetics at accessible price points for wedding budgets</li>\n    <li><strong>Ethical Sourcing:</strong> Partners who provide fair wages and safe working conditions</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p>\n    Only sets that pass all five criteria earn a place in the Milvertons collection. We reject dozens of options for every one we curate—so you never have to compromise.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>Why Curation Matters for African Celebrations</h3>\n  <p>\n    Generic luxury retailers don't understand the unique needs of Nigerian weddings, Aso Ebi parties, or Owambe celebrations. They don't know that:\n  </p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li>You need heels that photograph beautifully under African sun and indoor lighting</li>\n    <li>Matching clutch bags aren't optional—they're essential for coordinated Aso Ebi looks</li>\n    <li>Comfort matters for 6+ hours of dancing at traditional ceremonies</li>\n    <li>Color matching is critical when your entire group wears the same fabric</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p>\n    As curators specializing in this niche, we understand these needs intimately. Every set in our collection is chosen with your celebration in mind.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>The Milvertons Advantage: Curated Selection, US-Based Service</h3>\n  <p>\n    When you shop Milvertons, you get the best of both worlds:\n  </p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Global Curation:</strong> Access to Italian-inspired designs sourced from trusted international partners</li>\n    <li><strong>Local Convenience:</strong> Free shipping on all USA orders </li>\n    <li><strong>Cultural Expertise:</strong> Styling guidance that understands Aso Ebi, Owambe, and African wedding traditions</li>\n    <li><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> Every set inspected before shipping—no surprises</li>\n    <li><strong>Community Trust:</strong> Join 6,800+ satisfied customers across the diaspora</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p>\n    We're not just a store—we're your fashion partner, curating luxury that celebrates who you are.\n  </p>\n</section>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
