    "custom_liquid_zYcULP": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"category-guides\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;\">\n  <h2>Complete Guide to Choosing Your Perfect Shoe & Bag Set</h2>\n  \n  <h3>👠 Heel Heights for Every Occasion</h3>\n  <p class=\"curator-intro\">\n    <strong>As your luxury fashion curators</strong>, we've tested dozens of Italian-inspired sets to bring you only the best. This guide shares what we've learned about heel heights, color matching, and embellishment styles—so you can choose with confidence for your next African wedding, Aso Ebi celebration, or gala.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>3-3.5 Inch Medium Heels:</strong> The sweet spot for most African weddings and parties. Tall enough to elongate your legs and complement flowing gowns, comfortable enough for 6+ hours of wear. Our bestselling rhinestone sets feature this height. Perfect for: church weddings, reception dinners, evening Aso Ebi celebrations.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>4+ Inch Statement Heels:</strong> For the bold bride, bridesmaid, or guest who wants to make an entrance. These Italian-inspired stilettos command attention and photograph beautifully. Pair with a clutch bag for red carpet moments. Perfect for: bridal looks, gala entrances, award ceremonies, fashion-forward Owambe parties.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>🎨 Color Matching for Aso Ebi & African Weddings</h3>\n  <p>\n    <strong>Neutral Sets (Nude, Beige, Champagne):</strong> The ultimate versatile choice. Neutral Italian shoe and bag sets complement any Aso Ebi fabric color, from bright coral to deep burgundy. They elongate the leg and keep focus on your outfit's intricate details. Best for: when your Aso Ebi fabric has multiple colors, when you want timeless elegance, when you'll reuse the set for multiple events.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>Metallic Sets (Gold, Silver, Rose Gold):</strong> Add glamour without clashing. Metallic rhinestone sets catch light beautifully in photos and pair well with both warm and cool-toned fabrics. Gold complements yellow, orange, and green Ankara prints. Silver enhances blue, purple, and burgundy lace. Best for: evening receptions, galas, when you want to add sparkle to a simple outfit.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>Bold Color Sets (Royal Blue, Emerald, Burgundy, Red):</strong> Make a statement. Our colored Italian shoe and bag sets are perfect when you want your accessories to be part of the conversation. Match them to accent colors in your fabric or go tonal for a monochromatic look. Best for: when your Aso Ebi group chose a specific color, when you want to stand out, for themed parties.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>💎 Embellishment Styles</h3>\n  <p>\n    <strong>Rhinestone & Diamond-Embellished:</strong> Our signature style. Hand-placed crystals create maximum sparkle for weddings and galas. These Italian-inspired sets feature everything from subtle toe-cap accents to full-coverage glamour. Best for: bridal looks, evening events, when you want to shine in photos.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>Minimalist Elegance:</strong> Clean lines, premium leather, subtle hardware. Perfect for women who prefer understated luxury or need versatile sets for professional events. Best for: daytime weddings, office parties, when your outfit is already heavily embellished.\n  </p>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>Pearl & Beaded Details:</strong> Romantic and feminine, these sets complement lace fabrics and soft color palettes. Perfect for spring weddings, bridal showers, and traditional ceremonies. Best for: brides, bridesmaids, romantic Aso Ebi looks.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3>👜 Clutch Bag Features to Consider</h3>\n  <p>\n    Most Milvertons matching clutch bags include:\n  </p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Size:</strong> 8-10 inches wide—large enough for phone, lipstick, tissues, and cards</li>\n    <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Secure magnetic snap or zipper to protect your belongings</li>\n    <li><strong>Strap Options:</strong> Detachable chain or wristlet for hands-free convenience</li>\n    <li><strong>Interior:</strong> Lined with soft fabric, includes card slots in select styles</li>\n    <li><strong>Embellishment Match:</strong> Rhinestones, pearls, or hardware mirror the shoe design</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p>\n    <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> If you'll be dancing all night, choose a clutch with a wristlet or chain strap so you can wear it crossbody while keeping your hands free.\n  </p>\n</section>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
